EN:
Hey, sprout! I need a cup of coffee!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
And it shouldn't have too much or
too little milk. The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}regular {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}amount!

ES:
¡Quiero un café, granujilla!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Que no tenga ni mucha leche
ni poca. ¡Con {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}lo justo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

TRANSLATION:
