IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Perbacco!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Che bontà!{{TAG:0007:000E:}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Il caffè come
lo fate voi non lo fa nessun altro!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Mi vedrai qui più spesso in futuro!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Mmm{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} ¡Bastante bien, granujilla!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Si llevara la cantidad justa
